<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Santiago started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Santiago started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said Tuesday it started coverage on the shares of Chile's Banco Santiago with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Brent Erensel said in a research note that the largest bank in Chile benefited from a favorable macroeconomic environment, new banking powers authorized by pending legislation and a combination of revenue synergy and cost reduction following its merger with O'Higgins.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 25-1/8 in New York.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
